	(text_box "Notes on DS3231:\nWe should use pullup resistors on SDA, SCL and INT/SQW lines.\nbut in prototype, it worked without the pullups, so omitted here (less power)\nWhen powering the ds3231 for the first time, VCC should be powered. Once the\nbattery powered wakeup register is enabled, you can remove the connection, I guess."
